      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where do you deliver to?",
            "answer": "<p>The United Kingdom, from a UK warehouse. Delivery is free on two pairs or more; on a single pair it is charged at checkout and shown before you pay.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you deliver outside the UK?",
            "answer": "<p>This is still being confirmed and we will not promise a service we cannot yet support. If you are outside the UK, email us and we will tell you honestly where things stand.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return them if I have worn them?",
            "answer": "<p>Returns are for unworn socks in the original packaging with the seal intact — you may inspect them as you would in a shop. If a pair is faulty, that is a different matter entirely and worn or not makes no difference.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if my order does not arrive?",
            "answer": "<p>Email or phone us with the order number and we will chase it with the courier. Until the parcel is with you, the responsibility for getting it there is ours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change or cancel an order?",
            "answer": "<p>If it has not been dispatched, yes — email or phone us straight away. After dispatch it becomes a return, and you have fourteen days from the day the parcel arrives to tell us you are cancelling.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer exchanges?",
            "answer": "<p>If a size is wrong, the simplest route is to return the unworn pair and order the right one. Contact us before sending anything back and we will tell you exactly what to do.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "q1",
