          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where are HydroSox made?",
            "answer": "<p>We have not published a country of manufacture yet, and we are not going to print one we have not confirmed with the manufacturer. It is a fair question, it will be answered here plainly when we can evidence it, and in the meantime what we can say is that HydroSox is a UK registered company shipping from a UK warehouse.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you sell to shops, or wholesale?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. There is no public trade pricing and no automated tiering — tell us what you sell and to whom on the trade page, and we will reply with terms that fit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I pay?",
            "answer": "<p>Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Apple Pay, Google Pay and Shop Pay. Checkout is guest by default, so no account is needed. We never see or store your full card details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is there a shop I can visit?",
            "answer": "<p>No. HydroSox is online only, from a UK warehouse. The registered address and phone number are on every page of this site rather than behind a contact form, so there is always a person to reach.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
